{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And the heavens shall praise</b> — Now the psalmist declares that HaShem is El of truth and His word shall be truth. The meaning of ויודו שמים: the heavens, in their constant motion, shall praise Your wonders and Your faithfulness. <b>And faithfulness in the congregation of the holy ones</b> — these are the angels that set them in motion."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 89, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:24.889600225Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}